835	 *  (executed by the game on config-exec/map-load; this specific TF2 command,
836	 *  not CS2's `host_workshop_collection`, is what actually works for this
837	 *  game — confirmed via the long-standing Valve-endorsed community guide,
838	 *  since wiki.teamfortress.com has no Workshop page of its own). GATED: the
839	 *  dedicated server cannot fetch ANY Workshop map without a real
840	 *  `SRCDS_WORKSHOP_AUTHKEY` set on the container (cm2network/tf2's own
841	 *  documented requirement) — Nxeon does not provision one today, so this
